content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Import external tasks from assert.yml to be executed once on localhost\n  import_tasks: assert.yml\n  delegate_to: localhost\n  run_once: true\n\n- name: Install DNS-related packages\n  package:\n    name: "{{ dns_packages }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Create necessary directories for DNS configuration and data\n  file:\n    path: "{{ item }}"\n    state: directory\n    owner: "{{ dns_owner }}"\n    group: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    mode: \'0755\'\n  loop:\n    - "{{ dns_datadir }}"\n    - "{{ dns_confdir }}"\n\n- name: Create a group for DNS service\n  group:\n    name: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Create a user for the DNS service\n  user:\n    name: "{{ dns_owner }}"\n    system: true\n    state: present\n    create_home: no\n\n- name: Generate the rndc key for DNS configuration\n  command: rndc-confgen -a\n  args:\n    creates: /etc/rndc.key\n\n- name: Set file permissions for the rndc key\n  file:\n    path: /etc/rndc.key\n    owner: "{{ dns_owner }}"\n    group: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    mode: \'0640\'\n\n- name: Download the root hints file if DNS caching is enabled\n  get_url:\n    url: "{{ root_hints_url }}"\n    dest: "{{ dns_datadir }}/root.hints"\n    owner: "{{ dns_owner }}"\n    group: "{{ dns_group }}"\n    mode: \'0644\'\n  notify: Rndc reload\n\n- name: Create primary zone files from templates\n  template:\n    src: "zone_{{ item }}.j2"\n    dest: "{{ dns_datadir }}/{{ item }}.zone"\n  loop: "{{ dns_zones }}"\n  notify: Rndc reload\n\n- name: Add DNS zones to the main configuration file\n  template:\n    src: named.conf.j2\n    dest: "{{ dns_confdir }}/named.conf"\n  notify: Restart DNS service\n\n- name: Create systemd service override if using systemd\n  block:\n    - name: Ensure systemd service override directory exists\n      file:\n        path: "/etc/systemd/system/{{ dns_service }}.service.d"\n        state: directory\n\n    - name: Copy override configuration file\n      copy:\n        src: override.conf\n        dest: "/etc/systemd/system/{{ dns_service }}.service.d/override.conf"\n\n    - name: Reload systemd\n      systemd:\n        daemon_reload: true\n  when: service_manager | lower == \'systemd\'\n\n- name: Start and enable the DNS service\n  service:\n    name: "{{ dns_service }}"\n    state: started\n    enabled: true\n``` \n\nIn this corrected playbook, the issue with the truthy value in the `when` condition for the systemd service override was addressed by ensuring the comparison was made against a lowercase string using `| lower`.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-14T21:57:34.497617814Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 9636324138, 'load_duration': 67133136, 'prompt_eval_count': 1404, 'prompt_eval_duration': 7140547, 'eval_count': 621, 'eval_duration': 9561487255, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--291fb386-352e-4d62-8376-952fb228f778-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1404, 'output_tokens': 621, 'total_tokens': 2025}
