es and order, adheres to yamllint's line-length requirement, and ensures all tasks are functionally equivalent to the original. The only change made was formatting to ensure no line exceeds 80 characters, as per the error message." additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-14T22:16:32.887066324Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 10549076029, 'load_duration': 56706537, 'prompt_eval_count': 1453, 'prompt_eval_duration': 12278213, 'eval_count': 607, 'eval_duration': 10478417354, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--d67ed13d-1079-4460-8e52-4b6f6c2a7c3d-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1453, 'output_tokens': 607, 'total_tokens': 2060}
