content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Install SSL packages\n  ansible.builtin.package:\n    name: "{{ httpd_ssl_packages }}"\n    state: present\n\n- name: Place SSL configuration file\n  ansible.builtin.template:\n    src: ssl.conf.j2\n    dest: "{{ httpd_config_directory }}/ssl.conf"\n    mode: \'0644\'\n  notify: \n    - Test HTTP server configuration\n    - Restart HTTP server\n\n- name: Configure HTTP to HTTPS redirect\n  ansible.builtin.template:\n    src: default_vhost.conf.j2\n    dest: "{{ httpd_config_directory }}/default_vhost_conf"\n    mode: \'0644\'\n  notify: \n    - Test HTTP server configuration\n    - Restart HTTP server\n\nhandlers:\n  - name: Test HTTP server configuration\n    ansible.builtin.command:\n      cmd: httpd -t\n\n  - name: Restart HTTP server\n    ansible.builtin.service:\n      name: httpd\n      state: restarted\n```\n\nThis YAML playbook strictly adheres to the instructions provided, ensuring each task is named and ordered exactly as specified. It includes handlers for testing and restarting the HTTP server as part of the tasks that notify them. The playbook uses appropriate Ansible modules and is structured to be included in an Ansible Role under the `tasks/` directory.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-14T22:32:00.617399178Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 3620041264, 'load_duration': 54459787, 'prompt_eval_count': 431, 'prompt_eval_duration': 27758928, 'eval_count': 272, 'eval_duration': 3536730294, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--5d85bbc9-3b11-4817-a290-2310d9b3ae42-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 431, 'output_tokens': 272, 'total_tokens': 703}
