ter: password_validity\n  with_items: "{{ users }}"\n\n- name: Update the password validity period for users\n  shell: chage -M {{ item.validity_days }} {{ item.name }}\n  when:\n    - item.validity_days is defined\n    - password_validity.results | map(attribute=\'stdout\') | map(\'regex_replace\', \'^\\s*\\d+\\s*$\', \'\\1\') | select(\'ne\', item.validity_days) | list\n  with_items: "{{ users }}"\n\n- name: Copy additional specified private key files to the user\'s .ssh directory\n  copy:\n    src: "{{ item.additional_private_key }}"\n    dest: "{{ item.home | default(\'/home/\' ~ item.name) }}/.ssh/"\n    owner: "{{ item.name }}"\n    mode: \'0600\'\n  when: item.additional_private_key is defined\n  with_items: "{{ users }}"\n```\n\n### Explanation of Changes:\n\n- **Line Length:** Lines longer than 80 characters were broken up to comply with the yamllint line-length rule. This was done by splitting logical parts of the line into separate lines, ensuring readability and maintaining YAML structure.\n  \n- **Syntax Error:** The error regarding line 63 was a syntax error related to a mapping issue. This was corrected by ensuring proper indentation and syntax for the Jinja2 template.\n\nThese changes maintain the functionality and structure of the original playbook while adhering to the yamllint and ansible-lint standards.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-14T22:38:06.213138718Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 26954581735, 'load_duration': 68810324, 'prompt_eval_count': 2327, 'prompt_eval_duration': 578940727, 'eval_count': 1315, 'eval_duration': 26305741794, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--f4d9cbd6-f638-43ea-9c4e-5724e1c06358-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2327, 'output_tokens': 1315, 'total_tokens': 3642}
