ors.\n- Ensured `mode` defaults to `\'0644\'` where applicable in the task that configures additional rsyslog files.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-14T23:23:11.451211473Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 7935263302, 'load_duration': 62485649, 'prompt_eval_count': 2093, 'prompt_eval_duration': 911928352, 'eval_count': 527, 'eval_duration': 6959841170, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--db3fc496-aad0-42e1-b32d-2893406f4d50-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 2093, 'output_tokens': 527, 'total_tokens': 2620}
