content='```yaml\n---\n- name: Import assert.yml tasks file\n  ansible.builtin.import_tasks:\n    file: assert.yml\n  delegate_to: localhost\n  run_once: true\n\n- name: Install HashiCorp products using package installation method\n  when: installation_method == "package"\n  block:\n    - name: Download HashiCorp repository configuration for RedHat or Rocky\n      ansible.builtin.get_url:\n        url: https://apt.releases.hashicorp.com/gpg\n        dest: /etc/pki/rpm-gpg/RPM-GPG-KEY-hashicorp\n        mode: \'0644\'\n      when: ansible_facts[\'os_family\'] in [\'RedHat\', \'Rocky\']\n\n    - name: Ensure GPG package is installed for Debian\n      ansible.builtin.apt:\n        name: dirmngr\n        state: present\n      when: ansible_facts[\'os_family\'] == \'Debian\'\n\n    - name: Import HashiCorp GPG key for Debian\n      ansible.builtin.apt_key:\n        url: https://apt.releases.hashicorp.com/gpg\n        state: present\n      when: ansible_facts[\'os_family\'] == \'Debian\'\n\n    - name: Configure HashiCorp repository for Debian\n      ansible.builtin.apt_repository:\n        repo: "deb [arch={{ ansible_architecture }}] https://apt.releases.hashicorp.com {{ ansible_lsb.codename }} main"\n        state: present\n      when: ansible_facts[\'os_family\'] == \'Debian\'\n\n    - name: Install HashiCorp products\n      ansible.builtin.package:\n        name: "{{ hashicorp_products | map(\'regex_replace\', \'^(.*)$\', \'\\\\1\') | select(\'match\', \'(^|,)\') | list }}"\n        state: "{{ \'present\' if hashicorp_version is not defined else hashicorp_version }}"\n      when: installation_method == "package"\n\n- name: Install HashiCorp products manually\n  when: installation_method == "manual"\n  block:\n    - name: Download and extract HashiCorp products manually\n      ansible.builtin.unarchive:\n        src: "{{ hashicorp_product_url }}"\n        dest: "{{ hashicorp_product_dest }}"\n        remote_src: yes\n        owner: "{{ hashicorp_owner }}"\n        group: "{{ hashicorp_group }}"\n        mode: "{{ hashicorp_mode }}"\n```\n\nThis playbook includes the tasks structured according to your specifications. It starts with importing the `assert.yml` file, follows with package installation steps for both RedHat/Rocky and Debian systems, and ends with manual installation tasks. Each task is conditioned on the specified `installation_method` variable.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-14T23:26:41.90576621Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 7330472570, 'load_duration': 66519411, 'prompt_eval_count': 499, 'prompt_eval_duration': 52000304, 'eval_count': 559, 'eval_duration': 7210634224, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--d7b4f60f-d4e4-41da-9989-e46693cf5f46-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 499, 'output_tokens': 559, 'total_tokens': 1058}
